===Noun===
{{en-noun|cozies}}

# A padded or [[knit]] covering to keep an item warm, especially a teapot or egg.
# A padded or knit covering for any item (often an electronic device such as a laptop computer).

====Derived terms====
* [[tea cozy]]
* [[egg cozy]]

